      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1906-04-21_WidnesExaminer_art0046" n="art0046">
        <head>"BILE BEANS SAVED MY LIFE." ----- A Woman's Message to Suffering Women.</head>
        <p>"BILE BEANS SAVED MY LIFE." ----- A Woman's Message to Suffering Women.</p>
        <p>The great value of Bile Beans for all women's weak- nesses and ailments is due to their pure vegetable corn- Position, to their gentle end genial action, and to their Potency as a tonic-alterative. They adjust and maintain the delicate balance of all the vital functions, and help unhealthy organs to work out their own salvation. "Biles Beans saved my life," said Mrs. Eliza South- well, of 7, Vermont Villa. Vermont-street, Hull, to a local newspaper representative. Two years ago my health broke down completely," 3h5 continued. could not keep my strength up, for What little food I took would not remain on my stomach. The constant sickness reduced me to a state prostration, and I suffered agonies from neuralgia. wss under the impression that I had a cancer forming my inside. I became weak, too, from hremorrhage. Doctors' medicine did ma but little good. I was ordered to go into the country for a thorough change. "It was whilst I was in this shocking state that I W 5 recommended to try Bile Beans. I felt an improve- ment from the very commencement, and I am delighted to say that lam now miitle well and strong. Bile Beans have saved my life. " They have also been of great benefit to my husband, my married daughter, and my young grandson, who is :lost eight years ofd. The little fellow used to be sickly, but we gave him a Bile Bean once a week, and he is a bonny boy now. Bile Beans are our family medicine, and.l am thankful I knew about them." _ _</p>
        <p>Bile Beans, the world's most-sWcc—e.s.sful tonic-altera- tive, are sold only in sealed boxes. Of all chemists, or post free from the Bile Bean Mannfacturing Co., 4, Red-cross Street. Londoe, E.C., at Is. Id. or 2s. 9d. (the larger size contains three times'as ninny beans as •the Is. Id. size).</p>
      </div>
