        <head>NEW TALE NEXT WEEK!</head>
        <p>NEW TALE NEXT WEEK!</p>
        <p>6A SON OF EMPIREt!</p>
        <p>This is the title of the story which will commence in our issue of Friday next. It is from the pen of the well-known novelist and journalist, MORLEY ROBERTS.</p>
