        <head>AUTHOR OF</head>
        <p>AUTHOR OF</p>
        <p>"The Master of the Silver Sea," "The Adventures of a Ship's Doctor," " Strong Men and True," " The Keeper of the Waters," " The Colossus," etc.</p>
        <p>The Author of our story has a world-wide reputation. He went to Australia before he was twenty years of age, and worked on the Victorian railroads and in the bush of New South Wales, chiefly with sheep and cattle, Then he served as a sailor, and ultimately found his way into Government employment but the work of a civil servant was too slow for him, and he started on a long series of travels. Few men have had such a varied experience as MORLEY ROBERTS.</p>
