        <p>DELIVERY BOOKS. MEMORANDUM CARDS, SUBSCRIPTION CARDS. EXECUTED AT THE LOWEST PRICE WITH ME GREATEST DESPATCH.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1906-04-21_WidnesExaminer_art0108" n="art0108">
        <head>WE PRINT THE LARGEST POSTERS</head>
        <p>WE PRINT THE LARGEST POSTERS</p>
        <p>IN THE DISTR [CT.</p>
        <p>Plain or in two or more colours, are the most attractive that can be produced, and make a very bold and striking display on Hoardings and Walls.</p>
      </div>
